Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:2px;">Generating curve and axis</div>
<label>f(x) =
  <input id="generatingCurve" type="text" value="x^2" style="width:120px;">
</label>
